      "short": "$6.4\\text{ L}$",
      "worked": "Red : yellow $=12:15=4:5$.\n\nFor the additional paint:\n$$\\begin{align*}\n5\\text{ parts}&=8\\text{ L}\\\\\n1\\text{ part}&=8\\div5=1.6\\text{ L}\\\\\n4\\text{ parts}&=4\\times1.6=6.4\\text{ L}\n\\end{align*}$$\nFaith needs another $6.4\\text{ L}$ of red paint.",
